        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Schur, Rashida Jones, Charlie Brooker, Joe Wright, Peggy Lipton, Quincy Jones, Kidada Jones\n- Works: Nosedive\n- Roles: writer, teleplay writer, story creator, showrunner, director, actress, producer, singer, musician\n\nFacts:\n- Rashida Leah Jones was born on February 25, 1976.\n- Rashida Jones is an American actress, producer, singer, and writer.\n- Michael Schur and Rashida Jones wrote the teleplay for the episode \"Nosedive.\"\n- Charlie Brooker created the story for \"Nosedive\" and served as the series creator and showrunner.\n- Joe Wright directed the episode \"Nosedive.\"\n- Peggy Lipton was married to musician and producer Quincy Jones.\n- Peggy Lipton and Quincy Jones were the parents of Rashida Jones and Kidada Jones.\n- Rashida Jones and Kidada Jones both became actresses.",
